{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-02-04 09:15:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES CHANGES TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT AFTER YEARS OF DISTINGUISHED SERVICE ALEXANDRE VAN DAMME, DIRECTOR NOMINEE OF BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC. (“BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY”), WILL RETIRE FROM THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOLLOWING THE END OF HIS TERM. BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HAS INDICATED THAT IT PLANS TO NOMINATE ALICIA KNAPP, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF BHE RENEWABLES, TO FILL MR. VAN DAMME'S VACANCY AT THE KRAFT HEINZ 2022"}